c6b383-5392-4749-8c0b-b1554f7a35e6", "type": "concept", "title": "Opioid withdrawal and comfort care"}, {"id": "6d826594-77eb-4d50-b04a-695bd8c2deae", "type": "concept", "title": "CIWA/COWS awareness and escalation"}]}, {"id": "51c7d3e4-2826-407e-8848-213f10627a7c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Integrated recovery care", "description": "Many patients live with both substance use and mental health conditions.", "children": [{"id": "2d70c72e-433d-4835-ab1a-2784ed63de74", "type": "concept", "title": "Co-occurring disorders"}, {"id": "574b33a3-61d5-4010-a78a-b22fa1be3429", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication-assisted treatment awareness"}, {"id": "6a41d23c-f096-4cde-bbc9-f039507b08a0", "type": "concept", "title": "Harm reduction, relapse prevention, and referral"}]}]}, {"id": "b197be68-4b2a-43f0-8cb5-00981154baee", "type": "topic", "title": "Eating Disorders and Body Image-Related Conditions", "description": "Students learn medical and psychiatric nursing priorities for eating disorders and related risk states.", "children": [{"id": "32ca1b1c-ef75-418f-a526-cd1ae97c13b7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Eating disorder assessment", "description": "Students learn to recognize medical and psychiatric risk in eating disorders.", "children": [{"id": "5a77fc5f-e8ee-445d-a664-db2e71acae42", "type": "concept", "title": "Anorexia nervosa, bulimia nervosa, and binge-eating disorder"}, {"id": "e9bb85c1-8699-4fa0-bdb9-500ed4a89d38", "type": "concept", "title": "Vital signs, weight trends, labs, and purging behaviors"}, {"id": "429c9ea1-d8ff-44b6-979a-a5b9c717a739", "type": "concept", "title": "Body image, shame, secrecy, and control"}]}, {"id": "0f606777-2936-40bc-bf58-8f5833119761", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Medical safety", "description": "Eating disorders can create serious physiologic instability.", "children": [{"id": "4f14a8d2-bef8-4287-a3f0-b64298680e22", "type": "concept", "title": "Electrolyte imbalance and cardiac risk"}, {"id": "af967bd3-3601-4008-9984-e37fe382ba4a", "type": "concept", "title": "Refeeding syndrome awareness"}, {"id": "e390fb6d-06b8-4370-8e3c-ebb591c85b14", "type": "concept", "title": "Observation and meal support"}]}, {"id": "729637e8-b609-4bd5-88c1-955982b2e65c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Therapeutic care", "description": "Nursing care supports safety while preserving dignity.", "children": [{"id": "471633c4-1eff-4e7e-8a2f-ef7f16ba9eb9", "type": "concept", "title": "Nonjudgmental communication"}, {"id": "50ab95b7-a521-41f7-a558-4def877cb90d", "type": "concept", "title": "Family-based and interdisciplinary treatment awareness"}, {"id": "24ec0bb0-9101-46d9-b571-8de68d51dbe2", "type": "concept", "title": "Relapse prevention and discharge supports"}]}]}, {"id": "35d560fe-4d2c-4feb-b3a4-5ae8925e76ba", "type": "topic", "title": "Psychopharmacology and Medication Safety in Mental Health Nursing", "description": "This module links psychotropic medication classes to monitoring, side effects, adherence, and patient teaching.", "children": [{"id": "db05182e-698f-41fc-aace-8cc924827e0c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Medication classes", "description": "Students connect psychiatric symptoms to medication mechanisms and nursing monitoring.", "children": [{"id": "d65d98a8-3996-4607-b7ec-4880a213ad85", "type": "concept", "title": "Antidepressants and anxiolytics"}, {"id": "64cb80ce-136b-40de-a5e4-c8bb21dc3707", "type": "concept", "title": "Mood stabilizers and antipsychotics"}, {"id": "1a459c0e-88bd-4c69-be7f-67bcfd6e21e2", "type": "concept", "title": "Stimulants, sedatives, and medications for substance use"}]}, {"id": "8997b3de-6c36-4695-b3bc-2bbf6cd42750", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Adverse effects and monitoring", "description": "Psychotropic safety requires knowing what to watch for and when to escalate.", "children": [{"id": "1af1591f-3fe7-487a-86c1-e3c5112d5a1d", "type": "concept", "title": "Serotonin syndrome, neuroleptic malignant syndrome, EPS, metabolic effects, and QT risk"}, {"id": "a45f39aa-d248-4935